WEBVTT

00:12.640 --> 00:14.960
I merely asked you to reform the laws of one province

00:15.040 --> 00:16.440
Is it so difficult?

00:16.520 --> 00:17.440
Your servant is incompetent

00:17.600 --> 00:19.267
Indeed, I lack the ability

00:19.440 --> 00:21.440
I am willing to accept death

00:21.800 --> 00:22.800
Your servant

00:22.880 --> 00:24.547
Is already a useless person

00:24.680 --> 00:26.920
Should have followed my sister long ago

00:27.000 --> 00:27.960
You
